  m_text: "Creative Director: <b>Jix\r</b>\nLead Game Designer: <b>Mason Green\r</b>\nGame
    Designer: <b>Jay Madan\r</b>\nGame Writer, Narrative Designer: <b>Stephanie Wood\r</b>\n\r\nLead
    Developer: <b>Alexander Blehm\r</b>\nLead Developer: <b>Evan Dyer\r</b>\n\r\nLead
    Artist, 2D Artist: <b>Marcelo Injae\r</b>\nTechnical Artist, Character Designer,
    2D Artist: <b>toffl\r</b>\n\nComposer, Sound Designer: <b>Jared Kaye\r\r</b>\nProgrammer,
    Technical Sound Designer: <b>Ethan Bessette\r\r</b>\n<size=.75em>Violin: <b>Hope
    Chernesky\r\r</b>\nViola: <b>Freddie Oliveira-Chevres\r\r</b>\nCello: <b>Sammy
    Wetstein\r\r</b>\nBass: <b>Johnny Levine\r\r</b>\nPiano: <b>Jared Kaye\r</b></size>\n\r\nSpecial
    thanks to Emily for being our first playtester!\n"
